1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:02,377
The Knights have done the impossible,

2
00:00:02,502 --> 00:00:04,713
rising all the way from the bottom of the league

3
00:00:04,713 --> 00:00:05,547
to the Final Four,

4
00:00:05,672 --> 00:00:07,382
under head coach 
Ted Vincent!

5
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:10,427
Meanwhile, the Eagles, once a top contender

6
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:12,220
for the championship,
have suffered

7
00:00:12,387 --> 00:00:13,972
four straight losses.

8
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:16,307
Losers! Go home!
You're a damn disgrace!

9
00:00:18,435 --> 00:00:19,102
Idiots!

10
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:21,104
You can't even
win against

11
00:00:21,104 --> 00:00:22,480
the worst teams 
in the league!

12
00:00:27,569 --> 00:00:28,153
And you!

13
00:00:28,945 --> 00:00:30,280
Your plays get worse every damn game.

14
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:32,657
How are we supposed to win a title like that?

15
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:34,159
Why is it that the moment

16
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:35,493
I stopped using 
Ted's plays,

17
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:36,911
nothing works anymore?

18
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:38,038
Boss,

19
00:00:38,788 --> 00:00:40,540
we just got careless
these last few games.

20
00:00:41,249 --> 00:00:41,833
Don't worry.

21
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:43,752
We're gonna crush them next game.

22
00:00:44,085 --> 00:00:44,961
Oh, right.

23
00:00:45,253 --> 00:00:47,297
Next game, the semifinals against the Knights.

24
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:49,549
You lose that,

25
00:00:51,009 --> 00:00:52,594
every fucking
one of you is fired.

26
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:54,387
So we are here
in the locker room

27
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:55,847
with Knights' coach, Ted!

28
00:00:56,598 --> 00:00:57,182
Wait a second,

29
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:59,517
isn't that our former assistant coach?
